# Omni Watchdog — nightly audit (CFO 2026-08-21, "starting tonight 8 PM").
# Runs the day's rotation + the always-on checks (business rules, cross-module
# integrity, bug board, MACHINE-TALK), records the run + findings, raises one
# rolling task per DANGER finding, and emails the CFO a report (once per day).
#
# REPORT-ONLY by design: it never edits data, never touches permissions, never
# deploys code. Safe auto-fix is gated behind WATCHDOG_AUTOFIX_ENABLED (default
# off) and no auto-fixers are registered yet. Dangerous findings are ALWAYS
# report-only. (Same hard line as bug-triage: auto-pushing AI code to a live
# insurance ERP is out of scope.)
#
# 20:00 CAT == 18:00 UTC. Clock is UTC. Idempotent: the email is guarded once per
# day by watchdog.WatchdogReportLog, so a duplicate entry or a manual re-run does
# not re-email. Drop into /etc/cron.d via infra/install-crons.sh (chmod 644).
SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin

0 18 * * * root cd /opt/alpha-finance && /usr/bin/docker compose --env-file /etc/alpha-finance/.env exec -T backend python manage.py run_watchdog >> /var/log/alpha-finance/omni-watchdog.log 2>&1
